OL,3,AThe AI start-ups fixing India's broken
OL,4,Aroads and messy land records
OL,5,
OL,6,FFrustrated by the experience, he built
OL,7,FLandeed - an AI-led digital platform
OL,8,Fthat enables users to aggregate
OL,9,Ffragmented, multi-source land-records,
OL,10,Fverify titles and conduct legal checks
OL,11,Fat the click of a few buttons, across
OL,12,F24 states in India.
